CODE(1)                     User Commands                    CODE(1)

NAME
    code - source editor for C, Lua and shell scripts

SYNOPSIS
    code [file]

DESCRIPTION
    code opens the file in an editor window with syntax highlighting, an
    output pane and an outline of the definitions. Run saves the file and
    runs it: Lua files with lua, C files with tcc -run, shell scripts with
    sh; the output appears in the pane below the text. Languages are
    entries of a table in /usr/share/apps/code.lua; $HOME/.config/code.lua
    may add entries.

KEYS
    Ctrl+N  new file            Ctrl+Z  undo
    Ctrl+O  open                Ctrl+Y  redo
    Ctrl+S  save                Ctrl+F  find
    Ctrl+Q  quit                Ctrl+G  find next
    F5      run                 F6      stop

SEE ALSO
    tcc(1), sh(1)
